The constant evaluator accepted only scalar results of non-constructor
calls, did not evaluate a temporary returned by a function (`return
sv(p + pos, len)'), and lost a pointer into a string literal whose index
was not a plain constant; a case label was not type-checked as a constant
expression.  should_escape<char> lost its body ("expected constant
expression").
